  "caption": {
    "en": "The trader buys as soon as price touches the demand zone. Price keeps falling through it and the stop hits.",
    "bn": "Demand zone ছোঁয়ামাত্র buy। দাম zone ভেদ করে পড়তে থাকে ও stop লাগে।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "A zone is only an area of interest. Price later rebounded, but the trade was already closed.",
    "bn": "Zone শুধু আগ্রহের এলাকা। দাম পরে ফিরেছে, কিন্তু trade ততক্ষণে বন্ধ।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "A touch is not a signal",
      "bn": "শুধু touch কোনো signal নয়"
    }
  ],
